Stage 5 of 8: Money and Craft

Open a bank account early; auction bids and some purchases are backed
by bank liens, and your balance is shared across every branch. "rembank"
or "rembank balance" opens the account on first use and reports its
balance, lien, and spendable amount.

From anywhere that is not warded against teleportation, "rembank deposit
all" banks every carried coin and "rembank withdraw <amount>" brings
coins back. Use "rembank lien" to check reserved funds. The command
"rembank transfer <amount|all> from <alt>" pulls funds from one of your
registered alts into the current character. Balance and lien checks still
work in warded rooms.

Learn the player-driven economy: shops, the remote market, and the
live auction channel. When you want a break from fighting, professions
like fishing, mining, and smithing earn steadily and feed the market.

